                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Byron was a celebrated and celebrity poet. He met <persName key="SHE01">Percy</persName> and <persName key="SHE02">Mary Shelley</persName> at Lake 
 Geneva in 1816 and became very close to Percy. He was the father of  Godwin's step-daughter, <persName key="CLA03">Jane Clairmont's</persName>  child, Allegra. He spent much of his adult lfe 
abroad and died fighting for Greek independence.</p>
                        <p>Godwin recorded his death.</p>
                    </note>
